      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 5.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.91,
      "end_seconds": 13.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.61,
      "end_seconds": 29.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.62,
      "text": "I wanted to get restlessness looked at sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit i told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 30.72,
      "end_seconds": 40.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 69 beats a minute, BP is 121 over 75, temperature 37.0."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.09,
      "end_seconds": 45.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "good, thank you. Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.75,
      "end_seconds": 50.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "oh, I'd call it mild"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.6,
      "end_seconds": 55.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "What about impatience, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.8,
      "end_seconds": 62.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.3,
      "end_seconds": 75.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any thoughts of self-harm, drug use, head injury or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.31,
      "end_seconds": 86.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "I haven't had thoughts of self-harm, drug use, head injury or low mood, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.13,
      "end_seconds": 91.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.79,
      "end_seconds": 102.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, my heart's been fine, as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.7,
      "end_seconds": 119.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.47,
      "end_seconds": 131.53,
      "duration_seconds": 11.06,
      "text": "I'm on pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast. I mean, before this I was on omeprazole; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.26,
      "end_seconds": 136.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.04,
      "end_seconds": 150.9,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.81,
      "end_seconds": 167.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.26,
      "end_seconds": 180.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.18,
      "text": "I, I have acid reflux, for about ten years i didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.33,
      "end_seconds": 188.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "Okay, I can see acid reflux in your file as well. Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.45,
      "end_seconds": 195.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Yes, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.96,
      "end_seconds": 203.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.84,
      "end_seconds": 207.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.92,
      "end_seconds": 227.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "your pulse and blood pressure are normal and your examination is unremarkable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.46,
      "end_seconds": 231.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.22,
      "end_seconds": 261.88,
      "duration_seconds": 15.66,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at possible adult attention deficit disorder or anxiety. Let's get a thyroid test, for poor concentration. Use lists and reminders while we arrange the specialist assessment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.23,
      "end_seconds": 271.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "okay, go on. I'd like you to see the adult ADHD service as well, and I'll write the referral"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.57,
      "end_seconds": 279.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Can you send me for a questionnaire?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.15,
      "end_seconds": 293.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.65,
      "text": "I don't think that's needed at this stage, the history doesn't call for it. Come back after the assessment. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.59,
      "end_seconds": 297.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
